// (default key, reverse=False). Defined as insertion sort, so the result holds
// exactly the same items as the input, in ascending order.
function PySorted(s: seq<real>): seq<real>
{
  if |s| == 0 then []
  else Insert(s[0], PySorted(s[1..]))
